iter_36: Vault deposit_ref_fee requires the stored Router sender and deterministic vault identity.
iter_37: referral fee amount is added once and forwarded once; zero/max referral cases conserve amount.
iter_38: Vault load/deposit/save and withdraw-zero/save state persistence; repeated collection passed.
