iter_62: vault_idata owner/token/router tuple is reused by getter, deposit construction, and payout verification.
iter_69: referral arithmetic is fee-bounded and cannot inflate output or fee claims.
iter_78: deterministic vault tuple, Router-only deposit, stored amount withdrawal, and repeated/mismatched message rejection.
iter_83: withdrawal clears before save and a later Router-authenticated deposit recreates zero state; no replay claim.
