rg -n --no-heading -i 'vault.*storage|deposit_ref_fee|withdraw_fee|deposited_amount|schema|end_parse|vault_idata|vault.*withdraw|referral' CHAIN_HYPOTHESIS_TABLE.md iter_*/STATUS.yaml

Conclusion: CC5 is a direct duplicate of the Vault tuple, coin-width, deposit/save, withdrawal/clear, replay, and carry/destroy audit family. No malformed or external path produces a persistent selected-asset delta.
